      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12730/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place tuna steaks and olive oil in a large resealable plastic bag. Seal, and refrigerate for 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6ANr1peK9aGpTvXoxDSDGXhzn9Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12730-grilled-tuna-VAT-006-step-02-9b9ef0afb2a349f28bd3607fb2a2f0fd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12730/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the grill for medium heat. When coals are very hot, scatter a handful of hickory or mesquite wood chips over them for flavor.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/O7jp4SbP4KstZ004-sLXgvcqvug=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12730-grilled-tuna-VAT-007-step-03-9a109272a3b04354a04444cce84966e4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12730/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lightly oil grill grate. Season tuna with salt and pepper, and cook on the preheated grill approximately 6 minutes, turning once.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ziGCLs4zPCwmEKSe2FbHLCLBr-Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12730-grilled-tuna-VAT-008-step-04-df36edb553494ea9a13a77f759bd8376.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12730/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer to a serving platter, and drizzle with freshly squeezed lime juice. Serve immediately.",
